Package: correctedWS
Type: Package
Title: Corrected Welch-Satterthwaite Degrees of Freedom
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Matthias", "von Davier", email = "mvondavier@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Calculates corrected Welch-Satterthwaite effective degrees of
    freedom for weighted sums of independent variance components. Provides
    corrected-default one-sample, paired, and two-sample t-tests, together
    with the classical Welch-Satterthwaite calculation for explicit
    comparison.
